<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Nabisco Holdings Corp to market perform and removed the stock from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Nabisco lost 2-1/4 to 40-1/8.</p>
</text>
